alse,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-07-07T11:24:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T12:59:07Z","closed_at":"2026-07-07T12:57:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproduced in `4.8.dev`, `4.7.stable`, `4.3.stable`.\nPartially reproduced in `3.6.2.stable`.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9636) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.69 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen the \"inherits\" list has many classes using the \"right arrow\" icon, the order of inheritance becomes confusing (i.e. left-to-right or right-to-left?).\n\nThe white \"right arrow\" `->` icon is more eye-catching than the deep blue (accent colored) left arrow `<`, so it is easy to read the order wrong (in some cases, at first glance).\n\n| 4.7 |\n| ------------- |\n| <img width=\"387\" height=\"48\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e2e5f496-4b68-4db7-bad4-2ba7de3247b8\" /> |\n\n| 4.3 |\n| ------------- |\n| <img width=\"300\" height=\"37\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/248ac338-8bbf-4292-a232-ec217f55f556\" /> |\n\nFewer classes used the \"right arrow\" icon in 3.6.\n\n| 3.6 |\n| ------------- |\n| <img width=\"222\" height=\"37\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dfbac4e4-71e7-4b24-a264-29977b65f5b0\" /> |\n\nThe online doc does not have this issue (does not show icon):\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.7/classes/class_gradienttexture2d.html\n\n| 4.7 (online) |\n| ------------- |\n| <img width=\"394\" height=\"74\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b2b66602-a1df-43cf-8fd8-a8f42cb63bf3\" /> |\n\nIt may be better to swap out the \"right arrow\" icon.\nI do not have a proposed design as I am not a professional artist.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. In the \"Script\" tab, click \"Search Help\".\n2. Search for \"GradientTexture2D\" and open its offline documentation.\n3. Get confused by the \"inherits\" order at first glance. Is it left-to-right or right-to-left?\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"EdwardChanCH","id":97891482,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdW0mg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97891482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH","html_url":"https://github.com/EdwardChanCH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdwardChanCH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.